# pyglossary
===
The primary purpose is to be able to use our offline glossaries in any Open Source dictionary
we like on any OS/device.

There are countless formats, and my time is limited, so I implement formats that seem more
useful for myself, or for Open Source community. Also diversity of languages is taken into
account.
